只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"A temporal context graph, a memory API, retrieval primitives, and a multiple-platform integration mesh — designed to be embedded into any host process.","id":"gh:1329484633","install_available":false,"language":"TypeScript","name":"opencontext","slug":"melandlabs/opencontext","topics":["ai","ai-agent","context","dsh-plugin","harness","memory","runtime"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"A temporal context graph, a memory API, retrieval primitives, and a multiple-platform integration me"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"sh — designed to be embedded into any host process."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# OpenContext"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**Your agent forgets why it made decisions. OpenContext fixes that.**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"_The context layer for AI agents — a temporal context graph, memory API, and self-evolving loop in o"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"yer for AI agents — a temporal context graph, memory API, and self-evolving loop in one dependency._"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"**Context is the missing layer.** Retrieval answers _what_ happened. OpenContext answers _how_ what "},{"id":"p5s2","text":"happened became what is."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"**Unlike memory libs that only retrieve,** OpenContext keeps the _why_ — temporal timelines, belief "},{"id":"p6s2","text":"revision, and provenance."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"English · 简体中文"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"⭐ **If you find opencontext useful, please consider giving us a star on GitHub!** It helps more peop"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"le discover the project and motivates us to keep building. 🙏"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## What is OpenContext?"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"**OpenContext** is the agentic context runtime that sits underneath an agentic\napplication — and the"},{"id":"p10s2","text":" substrate you build your own agent on top of.\nIt is not a UI, a chat surface, or a model provider —"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"\nit is the glue between the things that make an agent useful: durable\nmemory, retrieval, context cor"},{"id":"p10s4","text":"rection, multi-platform connectivity,\nscheduled awareness, and a deterministic loop engine, all behi"},{"id":"p10s5","text":"tform connectivity,\nscheduled awareness, and a deterministic loop engine, all behind one dependency."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"→ Read `docs/architecture.md` for the full\ndata model, the lifecycle of a fact, and the transport su"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"cs/architecture.md` for the full\ndata model, the lifecycle of a fact, and the transport surface map."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Who is it for?"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"OpenContext fits teams who need to **engineer their context** — that is, teams whose day-to-day work"},{"id":"p13s2","text":" runs straight into the problems OpenContext was built to solve. Each bullet spells out the pain and"},{"id":"p13s3","text":" how OpenContext addresses it:"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"- **Software engineering teams.** Decisions scatter across GitHub PRs, Linear tickets, Slack threads"},{"id":"p14s2","text":", and Notion docs — across people, tools, and quarters. New hires ask *\"why did we pick X?\"* and no "},{"id":"p14s3","text":"one can answer. OpenContext's temporal graph stores every fact with `valid_from / valid_until`, so *"},{"id":"p14s4","text":"\"what did we believe last quarter?\"* is a real, citable query — not a guess.\n- **Efficiency / produc"},{"id":"p14s5","text":"tivity engineering teams.** The people building internal automation for the rest of the company. The"},{"id":"p14s6","text":"y don't want another SaaS — they want a runtime they can drop into a CLI, an MCP server, or a daemon"},{"id":"p14s7","text":". OpenContext is library-first, and the deterministic Loop engine only invokes the LLM when there is"},{"id":"p14s8","text":" real work, so it does not become a token-burning always-on loop.\n- **Office-assistant products.** A"},{"id":"p14s9","text":"ssistants that live inside Telegram, iMessage, WhatsApp, Lark/Feishu, and friends. Same agent code, "},{"id":"p14s10","text":"same context across channels. `IntegrationRecord` hides credentials, rate-limits, and reconnect logi"},{"id":"p14s11","text":"c, while `platform + messageId` is the natural audit trail for personal and work data.\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"|     | Capability                                                                      | What it do"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"es                                                                                                  "},{"id":"p16s3","text":"                                                                                                    "},{"id":"p16s4","text":"                                                                                                    "},{"id":"p16s5","text":"                                                                                    |"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"| 🧠  | **Temporal Context Graph** | A directed acyclic graph where every fact has `valid_from` / `va"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"lid_until`. Supersession, contradiction, and merge are first-class edges — corrections are append-on"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"ly, not destructive.                                                                                "},{"id":"p17s4","text":"                                                                                                    "},{"id":"p17s5","text":"                            |\n| 🔌  | **Platform Integration Mesh**                        | One unif"},{"id":"p17s6","text":"orm `IntegrationRecord` shape across Gmail, Slack, Telegram, Linear, Jira, iMessage, Feishu, Weixin,"},{"id":"p17s7","text":" … — credential rotation, rate-limit handling, and reconnect logic live behind the adapter.         "},{"id":"p17s8","text":"                                                                                                    "},{"id":"p17s9","text":"                                                                                     |\n| ⏰  | **Dete"},{"id":"p17s10","text":"rministic Loop Engine**                                | A scheduler that wakes up, decides whether "},{"id":"p17s11","text":"there is real work, and only then calls into the agent runtime. LLM calls are not the foundation — t"},{"id":"p17s12","text":"hey are the last step.                                                                              "},{"id":"p17s13","text":"                                                                                                    "},{"id":"p17s14","text":"                                                |\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Benchmarks"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Third-party memory and long-context recall benchmarks (numbers current as of 2026-08):"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"| Benchmark     | Score | What it measures                                                  |"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Why It Is Different"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"OpenContext is not a memory library and not a vector DB. It is a\nruntime substrate — the `@melandlab"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"s/opencontext` package bundles\ncontracts, memory-store, retrieval primitives, the loop engine, and\nt"},{"id":"p23s3","text":"he agent runtime behind one dependency."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"| Compared with…                                     | opencontext adds                             "},{"id":"p24s2","text":"                                                                  |"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"| A flat vector DB (Pinecone, Weaviate, Qdrant)      | A **temporal graph** — facts have `valid_from"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"` / `valid_until` and get superseded, not just similarity-matched |\n| A context/memory library      "},{"id":"p25s3","text":"                     | A **runtime, not a library** — HTTP daemon, MCP server, CLI, plus the integra"},{"id":"p25s4","text":"tions mesh and the loop engine    |\n| Wiring your own agent loop                         | A **separ"},{"id":"p25s5","text":"able Loop engine** that schedules when to wake the agent, instead of an LLM loop all the way down   "},{"id":"p25s6","text":"  |\n| Embedding opencontext just to get its integrations | **Single-package install** — one `pnpm ad"},{"id":"p25s7","text":"d` gets every capability, no React/Next/Tauri required to use         |"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## Architecture"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"Full data-flow diagrams, transport surfaces, and storage backends are\nin `docs/architecture.md`."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"### Architecture & Design"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"- `docs/architecture.md` — data model, lifecycle, data plane and control plane\n- `docs/philosophy.md"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"` — why this shape\n- Each package's `README.md` — API surface, examples, migration notes"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
